      "message": "test(post): the LN2W post joins the list tests on current main\n\nThe conformance list follows the registry order. The count of shipped\ntext posts in comment_escape is 26. The wire op of the AQ600L tests\nstates the new lead_arc_radius field (#4002).\n\nwire_post/model_arcs.rs states lead_arc_radius too: the wire_post test\nbinary does not compile on main without it (#4058), and the AQ600L tests\nare in that suite.\n\nRefs #4045, #4058\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
